  <item>
    <title>03. 当生活「便秘」了，你该怎么办？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691bd907cbba038b420d19ce</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">691bd907cbba038b420d19ce</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Nov 2025 02:27:07 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一个机缘巧合下，阿梨读到了陌生同事Aaron（Sheung-king尚敬）写的小说，而书中的主人公Glue——一个感到“人生被卡住”的男孩，让她产生了强烈的共鸣。尽管阿梨和主人公有着截然不同的人生经历，但那种被困住的迷茫感却异常相似。</span></p><p><span>作为读者和同事，阿梨对Aaron是如何开始写作产生了好奇，以及被说烂的“人生迷茫”，想问问他是否还有新的解法？</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fts6WHsf_tqBHJ9ojmraLEw3DoAb.jpeg"></figure><p><span>Aaron的艺术展</span></p><p><strong><span>本期制作人：阿梨</span></strong></p><p><span>一个喜欢听播客也在尝试做播客的小学老师，闲暇时也打打鼓、看看书和爬爬墙。作为「跳进兔子洞」的忠实听众之一，也常听「八分半」「随机波动」和其他泛文化休闲类的播客，有一档存放记忆和兴趣的个人播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65dc4db0b2c1b56af3051565" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/65dc4db0b2c1b56af3051565"><span>「雾中列车」</span></a><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>幕后制作</span></strong></p><p><span>声音设计：阿梨</span></p><p><span>编辑：佳勋</span></p><p><span>运营：梦妮</span></p><p><span>设计：鼠李糖</span></p><p><strong><span>相关阅读</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/710547/batshit-seven-by-sheung-king/" data-url="https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/710547/batshit-seven-by-sheung-king/"><span>Batshit Seven (2024), by Sheung-king</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.amazon.com/You-are-Eating-Orange-Naked/dp/1771666412" data-url="https://www.amazon.com/You-are-Eating-Orange-Naked/dp/1771666412"><span>You are Eating an Orange. You are Naked (2020), by Sheung-king</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.sheung-king.com/" data-url="https://www.sheung-king.com/"><span>Aaron的官网</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.cbc.ca/books/writers-trust-award-winners-1.7386578#:~:text=Sheung%2DKing" data-url="https://www.cbc.ca/books/writers-trust-award-winners-1.7386578#:~:text=Sheung%2DKing"><span>阿特伍德·吉布森作家信托小说奖：Winner of the 2024 Atwood Gibson Writers' Trust Fiction Prize&nbsp;</span></a></p><p><strong><span>关于这个节目</span></strong></p><p><span>「故事实验室」是由来自各行各业，但都对用声音讲故事感到好奇、热爱的人们制作的一档叙事播客。如果你也想要尝试制作一期叙事播客，欢迎来参加我们的创作营（详情请添加monifromnowhere）。期待与你一起创作，一起玩！</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu0JBVNQbTmFKcUKtXXwiFlsCWfV.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhBWzdlOQEkh9VvR_UjxLeGPntX-.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtYrG3TQkfAE-FMHnSPFr-2UcqTP.png"></figure><p><strong><span>收听渠道</span></strong></p><p><span>小宇宙｜QQ音乐｜苹果播客｜Spotify</span></p>]]></description>
